os."],"notas_en":["The City Council does not record in SAPL the progress of most bills (145 of 145 filed since January 1, 2025), so their status shows as not recorded.","Each councilor's office spending is not included on this site: the City Council's open data system (SAPL) does not have it.","This City Council's SAPL system records no veto since January 1, 2025. Since there is no way to tell whether there was no veto or it was not recorded, the mayor's profile does not show the number of vetoes."],"conferido":"2026-10-31"}},"atualizado":"2026-10-30","onde":{"camara":{"site":"https://www.baraodecotegipe.rs.leg.br/","sistema":"sapl","api":"https://sapl.baraodecotegipe.rs.leg.br/api/","propostas":"https://sapl.baraodecotegipe.rs.leg.br/materia/pesquisar-materia","propostasOnline":true,"sic":"https://www.baraodecotegipe.rs.leg.br/ouvidoria","conferido":"2026-10-28","motivo":null,"motivo_en":null},"prefeitura":{"site":"https://www.baraodecotegipe.rs.gov.br/","transparencia":"https://www.baraodecotegipe.rs.gov.br/site/transparencia","sic":"https://baraodecotegipe.rs.gov.br/site/sic","diarioOficial":{"nome":"Diário Oficial dos Municípios (Federação das Associações de Municípios do Rio Grande do Sul - FAMURS)","url":"https://www.diariomunicipal.com.br/famurs/","plataforma":"SIGPub (diariomunicipal.com.br)","entidade":"169493"},"conferido":"2026-10-28"}}}
